<title>USA: HomeLife says to acquire Funders Mortgage.</title>
<headline>HomeLife says to acquire Funders Mortgage.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>HomeLife Inc on Thursday said it has signed a letter of intent to acquire Funders Mortgage Corp of America, based in Southern California, for about 600,000 common shares, or about $3.0 million worth of stock.</p>
<p>HomeLife expects to close the deal within 60 days, it said in a statement.</p>
